// F35, design (i): the deployed model's Snapshot Value per target, analysis, metric, and bin, for the live proof's check
// of the kept form's DAX against its reference, keptFormValues (in fabric/app: npx tsx scripts/f35-proof.ts
// <export.jsonl> --from <instant> --to <instant> --model <response.json>). Run it on the model with the Power BI REST
// API's Execute Queries (https://learn.microsoft.com/rest/api/power-bi/datasets/execute-queries-in-group), and save its
// response as it is. BinsFrom and BinsTo are --from and --to, in UTC: a response holds at most 100,000 rows, about four
// days of a demo's history. Rows without a bin aren't in it, and f35-proof.ts leaves them out too.
DEFINE
    VAR BinsFrom = DATE ( 2026, 11, 18 ) + TIME ( 0, 0, 0 )
    VAR BinsTo = DATE ( 2026, 11, 22 ) + TIME ( 0, 0, 0 )

EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Telemetry Snapshots'[Target Key],
    'Telemetry Snapshots'[Analysis Key],
    'Telemetry Snapshots'[Metric],
    'Telemetry Snapshots'[Bucket UTC],
    FILTER (
        ALL ( 'Telemetry Snapshots'[Bucket UTC] ),
        'Telemetry Snapshots'[Bucket UTC] >= BinsFrom
            && 'Telemetry Snapshots'[Bucket UTC] < BinsTo
    ),
    "snapshot_value", [Snapshot Value]
)
